<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Laplace–Young Circumferential Epithelial Wall Stress Monotonicity Law" ;
    dct:description "Connects positive transmural pressure ΔP to circumferential tensile stress in the distal airway epithelium that activates FGF10/ERK1/2/Etv4 tip proliferation | Variables: σ_θ: circumferential Laplace hoop tension across distal epithelial wall (Pa); R: distal epithelial bud luminal radius (μm); h: epithelial wall thickness (μm)" ;
    dct:source "Nelson et al. (2017) Development 144:4328-4335; Jaslove & Nelson (2018) Development 145:dev167395" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py#L140-L215>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_059_tracheal_viscous_fingering.lean#L56-L78> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def laplace_hoop_stress_scaled (dP R : Int) : Int :=
  dP * R
theorem laplace_epithelial_hoop_stress_monotonicity
    (P_lum P_pl c dP1 dP2 R : Int)
    (hR : 0 < R)
    (hdP : dP1 < dP2) :
    laplace_hoop_stress_scaled (transmural_pressure (P_lum + c) (P_pl + c)) R =
      laplace_hoop_stress_scaled (transmural_pressure P_lum P_pl) R ∧
    laplace_hoop_stress_scaled dP2 R - laplace_hoop_stress_scaled dP1 R =
      (dP2 - dP1) * R ∧
    laplace_hoop_stress_scaled dP1 R < laplace_hoop_stress_scaled dP2 R
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "σ_θ(ΔP, R, h) = (ΔP · R) / h  ⇒  (R > 0 ∧ h > 0 ∧ ΔP_2 > ΔP_1) ⟹ σ_θ(ΔP_2) > σ_θ(ΔP_1)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2009.12.010>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.08.012>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mod.2007.11.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature07005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1113/jphysiol.1974.sp010659>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1152/jappl.1986.60.1.160>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1152/jappl.1996.81.1.209>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.154823>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.167395> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Coupled Laplace–Young Transmural Epithelial Wall Stress, Mechanosensitive FGF10/ERK1/2/Etv4 Tip Bifurcation Rate & Synchronized Airway Smooth Muscle (ASM) Peristaltic Calcium Waves" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_059.laplace_hoop_stress_scaled" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_059.laplace_epithelial_hoop_stress_monotonicity" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Tracheal Drainage & Nifedipine ASM Blockade Hypoplasia Arrest Law" ;
    dct:description "Explains why either tracheal intubation drainage (ΔP ≤ ΔP_c) or nifedipine Ca2+ channel blockade (α_ASM → 0) arrests embryonic lung branching into hypoplasia | Variables: Γ_branch: terminal bud bifurcation rate (day^-1); ΔP_c: critical transmural distension threshold (50 Pa); K_P: half-saturation pressure (140 Pa); α_ASM: airway smooth muscle L-type Ca2+ peristaltic activity factor" ;
    dct:source "Nelson et al. (2017) Development 144:4328-4335 Figs. 3-4; Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell 34:668-681; Unbekandt et al. (2008) Mech. Dev. 125:314-324" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py#L150-L320>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_059_tracheal_viscous_fingering.lean#L93-L119> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def excess_pressure_pos (dP dP_c : Int) : Int :=
  if dP <= dP_c then 0 else dP - dP_c
def branching_rate_numerator (alpha_asm dP dP_c : Int) : Int :=
  alpha_asm * (excess_pressure_pos dP dP_c * excess_pressure_pos dP dP_c)
theorem tracheal_drainage_and_nifedipine_hypoplasia_arrest
    (alpha_asm dP_sub dP_sup dP_c : Int)
    (h_alpha : 0 < alpha_asm)
    (h_sub : dP_sub <= dP_c)
    (h_sup : dP_c < dP_sup) :
    branching_rate_numerator alpha_asm dP_sub dP_c = 0 ∧
    branching_rate_numerator 0 dP_sup dP_c = 0 ∧
    0 < branching_rate_numerator alpha_asm dP_sup dP_c
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Γ_branch(ΔP, α_ASM) = Γ_0 α_ASM (ΔP - ΔP_c)_+^n / (K_P^n + (ΔP - ΔP_c)_+^n)  ⇒  (ΔP ≤ ΔP_c ∨ α_ASM = 0) ⟹ Γ_branch = 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2009.12.010>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.08.012>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mod.2007.11.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature07005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1113/jphysiol.1974.sp010659>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1152/jappl.1986.60.1.160>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1152/jappl.1996.81.1.209>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.154823>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.167395> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Coupled Laplace–Young Transmural Epithelial Wall Stress, Mechanosensitive FGF10/ERK1/2/Etv4 Tip Bifurcation Rate & Synchronized Airway Smooth Muscle (ASM) Peristaltic Calcium Waves" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_059.branching_rate_numerator" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_059.tracheal_drainage_and_nifedipine_hypoplasia_arrest" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Poiseuille Airway-Tree Luminal Pressure Accumulation Law (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Spatially resolves luminal pressure on the 3D bronchial tree with distributed secretion sources; proves the distal tip transmural pressure is never below the tracheal one and that intra-tree drops are non-negative (numerically < 0.01% of ΔP, validating the uniform-ΔP assumption of the 2D solver) | Variables: j_Cl(g): CFTR/NKCC1 chloride-driven secretion per unit epithelial area at generation g (nL/min/μm²); r_i, L_i: segment radius and length (μm); μ: lung-liquid viscosity (Pa·s); R_larynx: laryngeal outflow resistance; P_amn: amniotic pressure" ;
    dct:source "Olver & Strang (1974) J. Physiol. 241:327-357 (chloride-driven lung-liquid secretion); Harding, Bocking & Sigger (1986) J. Appl. Physiol. 60:160-165 (upper-airway resistance dominates); Metzger et al. (2008) Nature 453:745-750 (orthogonal bifurcation)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py#L365-L628>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_059_tracheal_viscous_fingering.lean#L138-L164> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def pressure_along_path : Int → List Int → Int
  | P, [] => P
  | P, d :: ds => pressure_along_path (P + d) ds
theorem poiseuille_tree_pressure_accumulation
    (P_trachea P_pleura : Int) (drops : List Int)
    (h_nonneg : ∀ d, d ∈ drops → 0 ≤ d) :
    P_trachea ≤ pressure_along_path P_trachea drops ∧
    P_trachea - P_pleura ≤ pressure_along_path P_trachea drops - P_pleura
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Q_i = Σ_{j∈subtree(i)} j_Cl(g_j)·2πr_jL_j,  R_i = 8μL_i/(πr_i⁴),  P_node = P_amn + R_larynx Q_tot + Σ_path R_i Q_i  ⇒  (∀ i: R_i Q_i ≥ 0) ⟹ ΔP(tip) ≥ ΔP(trachea)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2009.12.010>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.08.012>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mod.2007.11.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature07005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1113/jphysiol.1974.sp010659>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1152/jappl.1986.60.1.160>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1152/jappl.1996.81.1.209>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.154823>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.167395> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Coupled Laplace–Young Transmural Epithelial Wall Stress, Mechanosensitive FGF10/ERK1/2/Etv4 Tip Bifurcation Rate & Synchronized Airway Smooth Muscle (ASM) Peristaltic Calcium Waves" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_059.pressure_along_path" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_059.poiseuille_tree_pressure_accumulation" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Laryngeal Valve Duty-Cycle Monotonicity Law (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Explains tracheal occlusion hyperplasia (d = 0 maximises time-integrated ΔP) versus drainage / permanently open larynx hypoplasia (d = 1 minimises it); the Hill nonlinearity of Γ_branch yields a Jensen gap between time-averaged and mean-pressure branching | Variables: Q: luminal secretion rate; R_closed / R_open: laryngeal resistance with glottis adducted / during fetal breathing-movement episodes; d: open duty (out of D); P_amn: amniotic pressure; C: lung compliance" ;
    dct:source "Harding & Hooper (1996) J. Appl. Physiol. 81:209-224; Harding, Bocking & Sigger (1986) J. Appl. Physiol. 60:160-165; Unbekandt et al. (2008) Mech. Dev. 125:314-324; Nelson et al. (2017) Development 144:4328-4335" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py#L630-L720>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_059_tracheal_viscous_fingering.lean#L179-L216> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def valve_steady_pressure (P_amn Q R : Int) : Int :=
  P_amn + Q * R
def valve_cycle_integrated_pressure (P_open P_closed d D : Int) : Int :=
  d * P_open + (D - d) * P_closed
theorem laryngeal_valve_duty_cycle_monotonicity
    (P_amn Q R_open R_closed d1 d2 D : Int)
    (hQ : 0 < Q) (hR : R_open < R_closed) (hd : d1 < d2) :
    valve_steady_pressure P_amn Q R_open < valve_steady_pressure P_amn Q R_closed ∧
    valve_cycle_integrated_pressure (valve_steady_pressure P_amn Q R_open)
        (valve_steady_pressure P_amn Q R_closed) d2 D <
      valve_cycle_integrated_pressure (valve_steady_pressure P_amn Q R_open)
        (valve_steady_pressure P_amn Q R_closed) d1 D
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "C dP/dt = Q − (P − P_amn)/R_larynx(t),  R_larynx ∈ {R_closed, R_open},  P_open = P_amn + Q R_open < P_closed = P_amn + Q R_closed  ⇒  d₁ < d₂ ⟹ d₂P_open + (D−d₂)P_closed < d₁P_open + (D−d₁)P_closed" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2009.12.010>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.08.012>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mod.2007.11.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature07005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1113/jphysiol.1974.sp010659>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1152/jappl.1986.60.1.160>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1152/jappl.1996.81.1.209>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.154823>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.167395> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Coupled Laplace–Young Transmural Epithelial Wall Stress, Mechanosensitive FGF10/ERK1/2/Etv4 Tip Bifurcation Rate & Synchronized Airway Smooth Muscle (ASM) Peristaltic Calcium Waves" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_059.valve_cycle_integrated_pressure" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_059.laryngeal_valve_duty_cycle_monotonicity" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

